rtcuts with support for literal character keybindings and extended Kitty protocol. Enhanced Vim mode with missing motions (X, ~, r, f/F/t/T) and yank/paste support. Introduced tool isolation and sandboxing with SandboxManager for Linux bubblewrap/seccomp sandboxing. Implemented JIT context discovery for file system tools to improve model performance.\",\n         \"updateType\": \"release\",\n         \"url\": \"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\",\n         \"date\": \"2026-03-24\",\n         \"community_feedback\": []\n       },\n       {\n         \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n         \"title\": \"Self-hosted Cloud Agents\",\n         \"description\": \"March 25, 2026 release adds support for self-hosted cloud agents that keep your code and tool execution entirely in your own network. Your codebase, build outputs, and secrets all stay on internal machines running in your infrastructure, while the agent handles tool calls locally. Self-hosted cloud agents offer the same capabilities as Cursor-hosted cloud agents, including isolated VMs, full development environments, multi-model harnesses, plugins, and more.\",\n         \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n         \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n         \"date\": \"2026-03-25\",\n         \"community_feedback\": []\n       },\n       {\n         \"productName\": \"Gemini CLI\",\n         \"title\": \"Version 0.34.0 - Plan Mode Enabled by Default\",\n         \"description\": \"March 17, 2026 release enables Plan Mode by default to help break down complex tasks and execute them systematically. Added native gVisor (runsc) and experimental LXC container sandboxing support for safer execution environments.\",\n         \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n         \"url\": \"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\",\n         \"date\": \"2026-03-17\",\n         \"community_feedback\": []\n       },\n       {\n         \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n         \"title\": \"Computer Use Research Preview in Clau