test Apple silicon architecture.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"improvement\",\n    \"url\": \"https://codeium.com/windsurf/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-03-12\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Aider\",\n    \"title\": \"Main Branch - Latest Model Support\",\n    \"description\": \"Main branch updates include added support for Claude 4.5/4.6 models and updated model aliases, expanded Gemini model support with 2.5 Flash and Flash-Lite, added Gemini 3 preview models, DeepSeek Reasoner model support, and settings for new OpenAI GPT-5.1/5.2 and GPT-5-pro models across OpenAI, Azure, and OpenRouter.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://aider.chat/HISTORY.html\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-03-13\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Continue\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 1.3.33 - Claude Sonnet and Opus 4.6 Updates\",\n    \"description\": \"Latest release adds Claude Sonnet and Opus 4.6 model updates, integrates AI SDK provider, adds bash tool execution in background, turn-level prompt caching, PostHog metrics, live API tests, hooks system for CLI event interception, and 5 agent checks derived from codebase history. Includes multiple security upgrades and dependency updates.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/continuedev/continue/releases\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-03-15\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"Major Agentic Capabilities Improvements in GitHub Copilot for JetBrains IDEs\",\n    \"description\": \"March 11, 2026 release brings significant improvements to agentic capabilities within GitHub Copilot for JetBrains IDEs. Enhanced multi-step reasoning, better context awareness, and improved task execution for complex development workflows in IntelliJ IDEA, PyCharm, and other JetBrains IDEs.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog/\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-03-11\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  }\n]\n"
